 StyleBox["fib", "TI"],
 "]. Drawing coordinates belong to this result; the fibered graph itself \
remains unchanged."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ed8df9d0-8e3d-4d01-b9d6-d1448180dfa2"],

Cell[TextData[{
